WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 40

01:38.860 --> 01:40.490
Actually, it's easy to guess.

01:41.220 --> 01:43.090
What he wants

01:43.370 --> 01:44.920
is just Xiao En.

01:44.940 --> 01:46.770
But Fan Xian doesn't know

01:46.770 --> 01:48.920
where Xiao En is imprisoned.

01:49.770 --> 01:50.900
Do you know why

01:50.900 --> 01:52.310
I detained Xiao En?

01:52.330 --> 01:53.560
No. I don't.

01:53.580 --> 01:56.170
Just for this moment.

01:58.770 --> 01:59.750
Go to

01:59.770 --> 02:01.750
get He Daoren and Langtao here.

02:01.770 --> 02:03.050
Got it.

02:15.210 --> 02:16.320
Thank you, Grand General!

02:16.340 --> 02:18.010
It's such a pleasure to ride a horse

02:18.010 --> 02:19.190
and chat with you.

02:19.210 --> 02:20.560
See you!

02:29.780 --> 02:30.650
Spread the word.

02:30.650 --> 02:31.420
Do as planned

02:31.420 --> 02:33.040
by Fan Xian.

02:33.060 --> 02:34.240
Do it tomorrow!

02:34.260 --> 02:36.480
Fan Xian is not necessarily helping us with sincerity.

02:37.090 --> 02:39.280
He wants to take advantage of me

02:39.570 --> 02:42.800
to kill Shen Zhong!

02:42.820 --> 02:44.370
Your Excellency see it through?

02:44.450 --> 02:46.090
Not quite!

02:49.820 --> 02:51.090
I must kill

02:51.090 --> 02:52.620
Shen Zhong anyway!

02:52.620 --> 02:53.800
Yeah!

02:53.820 --> 02:55.120
According to the plan,

02:55.700 --> 02:57.550
after getting adoptive father out,

02:57.570 --> 02:59.810
Fan Xian is bound to coordinate in person.

03:00.850 --> 03:02.470
After getting out the Old Master,

03:02.490 --> 03:03.820
we can only run to Nanqing.

03:03.820 --> 03:05.690
When it comes, just take my order

03:06.180 --> 03:08.090
to kill Fan Xian.

03:08.290 --> 03:09.680
Then how will we go to Nanqing?

03:09.700 --> 03:11.970
Who said we have to go to Nanqing?

03:12.820 --> 03:14.160
After killing Fan Xian,

03:14.180 --> 03:16.040
we should run to the border quickly

03:16.060 --> 03:17.240
and gather the army.

03:17.260 --> 03:18.530
To revolt?

03:18.730 --> 03:20.840
Fan Xian's misjudgment

03:21.060 --> 03:22.060
is that he thinks

03:22.060 --> 03:23.730
running towards Nanqing

03:24.620 --> 03:26.400
is our only way to survive.

03:39.090 --> 03:41.560
Everything is ready now! We'll start tomorrow.

03:42.930 --> 03:44.210
I've met Shangshan Hu.

03:44.210 --> 03:45.450
Considering Shen Zhong's intelligence,

03:45.450 --> 03:47.400
he must know someone will rescue Xiao En.

03:47.620 --> 03:48.180
You want to create the deadlock

03:48.180 --> 03:49.920
like the tug of war?

03:50.290 --> 03:53.000
Either of them has to die anyway.

03:53.290 --> 03:54.730
Which one of them?

03:57.540 --> 03:58.990
It makes no difference.

03:59.010 --> 04:00.060
It's good to Nanqing

04:00.060 --> 04:02.200
for either of them to die.

04:02.620 --> 04:04.200
Shen Zhong can't be killed.

04:04.540 --> 04:05.680
What?!

04:05.700 --> 04:07.400
Shen Zhong can't be killed.

04:07.420 --> 04:08.690
Why?

04:08.780 --> 04:10.570
He Daoren lets you

04:10.570 --> 04:12.180
take over the Neiku's shop at Shangjing,

04:12.180 --> 04:12.850
right?

04:12.850 --> 04:14.120
Yes!

04:15.730 --> 04:17.530
The account book has problems.

04:18.860 --> 04:19.800
What are the problems?

04:19.820 --> 04:21.870
All the account books handed in by Shangjing

04:21.890 --> 04:23.800
to the capital city will be reviewed

04:23.820 --> 04:25.760
by the Investigator's Office over the years.

04:26.770 --> 04:29.880
It is very different from what is recorded here.

04:31.490 --> 04:32.750
So?

04:32.770 --> 04:35.150
So all the account books

04:35.170 --> 04:36.720
received by the Investigator's Office are fake.

04:38.610 --> 04:40.370
Judging from these,

04:40.490 --> 04:41.970
someone in the middle

04:42.050 --> 04:42.980
has held back

04:42.980 --> 04:44.600
a big amount of money.

04:45.300 --> 04:46.920
Trafficking!

04:48.930 --> 04:51.130
That looks like the Princess Royal's idea.

04:51.370 --> 04:54.170
The worse thing is that this sum of money

04:54.170 --> 04:56.280
was delivered to Nanqing territory

04:56.300 --> 04:58.160
by Shen Zhong's Embroidered Uniform Guards.

04:58.580 --> 05:00.090
Why would Shen Zhong help

05:00.090 --> 05:01.810
Li Yunrui with her illegal dealing?

05:01.930 --> 05:03.600
To make money from it?

05:05.210 --> 05:07.250
Shen Zhong is not greedy for money.

05:07.300 --> 05:09.010
There is only one possibility

05:09.090 --> 05:10.810
for him to agree with it.

05:12.140 --> 05:13.350
This sum of money

05:13.370 --> 05:15.440
will eventually lead to the civil strife of our dynasty.

05:17.330 --> 05:18.630
How much is it?

05:18.650 --> 05:20.200
It's enough to raise a camp of private army

05:20.370 --> 05:22.570
after so many years of accumulation.

05:23.210 --> 05:26.280
Armors, weapons, provisions,

05:26.300 --> 05:27.470
and horses

05:27.490 --> 05:29.320
are all the best type.

05:29.770 --> 05:31.410
They are enough to revolt

05:31.860 --> 05:33.920
at critical times.

05:34.650 --> 05:36.750
I'm afraid Princes Royal

05:36.770 --> 05:39.010
is not the only one involved.

05:39.820 --> 05:42.680
Princess Royal has been with the Crown Prince all the time.

05:42.700 --> 05:44.440
Is it a scheme from the Eastern Palace?

05:44.460 --> 05:46.000
We have to ask Shen Zhong

05:46.020 --> 05:47.720
for the truth.

05:48.370 --> 05:49.150
Who?

05:49.170 --> 05:50.600
Shen Zhong!

05:51.860 --> 05:52.910
He won't tell us.

05:52.930 --> 05:54.530
Then think of a way.

05:58.300 --> 05:59.140
Or you may marry

05:59.140 --> 06:00.030
his younger sister

06:00.050 --> 06:01.330
and become his family member.

06:01.330 --> 06:02.120
He will tell you

06:02.140 --> 06:03.190
whatever you ask.

06:03.210 --> 06:05.520
Fan Xian, this is critically important

06:05.540 --> 06:06.680
and allows no jokes.

06:06.700 --> 06:08.640
So you are aware this is a joke!

06:08.980 --> 06:09.700
Mr. Yan,

06:09.700 --> 06:11.590
do you know what you're talking about?

06:11.610 --> 06:12.580
Do you know

06:12.580 --> 06:13.420
how much efforts I made

06:13.420 --> 06:15.460
to work between different powers in Beiqi

06:15.460 --> 06:17.050
before I finally get tomorrow's chance

06:17.050 --> 06:19.250
to kill Shen Zhong?

06:19.370 --> 06:20.260
And you just said

06:20.260 --> 06:22.290
Shen Zhong can't be killed.

06:22.420 --> 06:23.580
And you want me

06:23.580 --> 06:25.720
to ask something confidential from him.

06:26.770 --> 06:28.170
Who do you think I am?!

06:28.170 --> 06:29.760
Do you think I'm god?

06:33.140 --> 06:36.290
Try to catch him alive and extract his confession by torturing.

06:53.170 --> 06:54.870
This is Shangjing.

06:54.890 --> 06:56.170
You want me to

06:56.170 --> 06:58.810
catch Shen Zhong alive here and extract
his confession by torturing!

06:58.860 --> 07:00.250
Yan Bingyun,

07:00.460 --> 07:02.200
I'm not ready to die yet.

07:06.300 --> 07:08.190
Head asked He Daoren to give you hints.

07:08.210 --> 07:10.070
He probably found something suspicious.

07:10.090 --> 07:11.330
That's the mission

07:11.330 --> 07:13.090
given to you and me by Head.

07:14.610 --> 07:15.520
Fine!

07:15.540 --> 07:16.280
Then ask Chen Pingping

07:16.300 --> 07:17.800
to come and investigate in person.

07:17.820 --> 07:19.910
Fan Xian, mind your identity!

07:19.930 --> 07:20.720
What's my identity?

07:20.740 --> 07:21.750
Director-General of the Investigator's Office.

07:21.770 --> 07:23.290
So what?

07:24.170 --> 07:25.910
Since you and I have joined the Investigator's Office,

07:25.930 --> 07:27.700
we should follow the Head's command

07:27.700 --> 07:29.240
to fight for Nanqing

07:29.260 --> 07:31.010
regardless of life and death.

07:32.740 --> 07:33.740
What if

07:33.740 --> 07:35.480
I want to stay alive?

07:40.090 --> 07:42.130
I was right.

07:42.700 --> 07:44.090
People like you

07:44.370 --> 07:47.290
don't deserve to be the Director-General
of the Investigator's Office.

07:53.300 --> 07:54.810
It's a deal.

07:55.420 --> 07:56.680
We rescue Xiao En tomorrow

07:56.700 --> 07:58.530
and take the chance to kill Shen Zhong.

07:59.210 --> 08:01.050
This is an

08:01.050 --> 08:02.480
unstoppable plan!

08:05.020 --> 08:06.560
You're still not physically recovered.

08:06.580 --> 08:08.370
It's better for you to stay indoors.

08:18.980 --> 08:19.610
Watch out!

08:19.610 --> 08:20.700
Don't damage the yard.

08:20.700 --> 08:21.920
Yes!

08:24.210 --> 08:25.440
Your Excellency!

08:27.650 --> 08:29.310
Watch Yan Bingyun for me!

08:29.330 --> 08:31.200
I need to know all his actions.

08:31.740 --> 08:32.920
Your Excellency!

08:34.170 --> 08:35.450
Sure!

08:56.490 --> 08:58.840
According to what Fan Xian said, this is the place.

09:01.930 --> 09:03.890
Go to the top of the mountain

09:05.220 --> 09:06.050
and act according to the plan.

09:06.050 --> 09:07.370
Yes!

09:56.340 --> 09:57.100
Commander,

09:57.100 --> 09:59.040
some people broke in the yard.

10:02.020 --> 10:03.690
Set out!

10:10.290 --> 10:11.440
Split up and sneak in!

10:11.460 --> 10:12.440
Find adoptive father as soon as possible!

10:12.460 --> 10:13.720
Yes!

11:01.730 --> 11:03.700
Your Excellency, I am Tan Wu!

11:03.700 --> 11:06.160
I'm here to get you out as requested by the Grand General!

11:13.100 --> 11:14.770
Your Excellency, I found him.

11:24.340 --> 11:25.240
I got him!

11:25.260 --> 11:26.480
Let's rush out!

11:33.700 --> 11:34.640
It's a trap!

11:34.660 --> 11:35.840
Let's escape from the back yard!

11:49.820 --> 11:51.480
Go back! Go!

11:55.530 --> 11:57.160
We're besieged.

11:57.970 --> 11:59.690
It is planned in advance.

11:59.780 --> 12:00.970
Is it a trap set up

12:00.970 --> 12:02.330
by Shen Zhong and Fan Xian?

12:03.900 --> 12:05.370
That doesn't matter anymore.

12:05.530 --> 12:06.920
Brothers,

12:08.580 --> 12:10.460
let's fight to death together.

12:10.460 --> 12:11.510
Grand General,

12:11.530 --> 12:13.150
you're of the Ninth Dan.

12:13.170 --> 12:14.370
There is still chance

12:14.370 --> 12:15.290
to survive

12:15.290 --> 12:16.640
if you fight alone.

12:16.660 --> 12:19.320
Running away on my own is not something I will do.

12:19.340 --> 12:20.470
If you don't go,

12:20.490 --> 12:22.370
who will avenge us?

12:24.530 --> 12:25.370
Grand General!

12:25.370 --> 12:26.690
Stop it!

12:32.850 --> 12:36.960
Please avenge us!

12:38.820 --> 12:42.570
Please avenge us!

13:05.020 --> 13:05.800
Commander!

13:05.820 --> 13:07.080
How is it?

13:07.100 --> 13:08.600
We have besieged them.

13:16.260 --> 13:17.910
Let's take a look!

13:17.930 --> 13:19.160
Yes!

13:38.820 --> 13:40.210
Stop!

13:58.660 --> 14:00.210
Shen Zhong!

14:02.780 --> 14:04.480
Where is Shangshan Hu?

14:04.700 --> 14:05.760
Commander,

14:05.780 --> 14:07.010
they are all the ones left

14:07.170 --> 14:08.920
when we besieged them.

14:11.050 --> 14:14.390
It's not easy to catch a martial arts master of Ninth Dan

14:14.410 --> 14:16.040
if he wants to escape.

14:18.410 --> 14:20.210
Tan...

14:21.820 --> 14:23.330
Tan Wu!

14:23.610 --> 14:25.010
I have met you before!

14:27.220 --> 14:28.510
I keep Xiao En

14:28.530 --> 14:31.370
as a bait to attract Shangshan Hu.

14:32.050 --> 14:33.440
I'm already too eager to wait any longer.

14:33.460 --> 14:36.770
Shangshan Hu? What does this have to do with him?

14:37.850 --> 14:39.840
You still want to protect him?

14:40.290 --> 14:42.450
We started this simultaneously.

14:42.970 --> 14:44.480
It has nothing to do with others.

14:44.660 --> 14:46.770
It's doesn't matter whether you admit it or not.

14:46.820 --> 14:48.950
You are Shangshan Hu's personal guard.

14:48.970 --> 14:52.270
Catching you is enough to convict him.

14:52.290 --> 14:54.000
The border army has gone through many battles.

14:54.020 --> 14:56.330
No one ever allows himself to be
seized without putting up a fight.

14:58.490 --> 15:00.480
I know you want to fight to death.

15:00.530 --> 15:02.210
I don't care!

15:03.700 --> 15:05.590
Your corpse is equally enough

15:05.610 --> 15:08.570
to convict Shangshan Hu.

15:09.290 --> 15:10.780
What will be the charges?

15:10.780 --> 15:12.770
You will be the charges.

15:32.370 --> 15:33.950
How do you convict him

15:33.970 --> 15:35.270
with a bunch of faceless corpses?

15:35.290 --> 15:36.880
You want to burn up the traces?

15:36.900 --> 15:37.900
Your gravestone will not even

15:37.900 --> 15:40.130
have any names.

15:41.100 --> 15:44.560
We've been arrogant and rebellious while living.

15:44.580 --> 15:46.370
It's fair enough to die into lonely ghosts.

15:46.410 --> 15:48.830
His Excellency Xiao is unimaginably outstanding

15:48.850 --> 15:50.590
and shall not be humiliated with another kidnapping.

15:50.610 --> 15:53.400
Let him go with us together today!

15:54.970 --> 15:57.130
Do it! Do it now!

15:57.730 --> 15:59.450
Protect His Excellency!

16:02.580 --> 16:07.330
Fan Xian set me up and Shen Zhong killed me!

16:10.780 --> 16:14.810
Fan Xian set me up and Shen Zhong killed me!

16:45.100 --> 16:46.120
Hurry up!

16:46.140 --> 16:47.170
Fetch more water!

16:47.170 --> 16:50.330
They deserve to be the border army of Beiqi!

16:52.850 --> 16:54.330
What a pity!

17:06.130 --> 17:07.720
They are all charred. Absolutely no chance of surviving!

17:07.740 --> 17:09.480
This is Xiao En judging from the body shape.

17:10.820 --> 17:12.110
How about the leg injury?

17:12.130 --> 17:13.440
The leg injury matches as well.

17:14.050 --> 17:15.150
Is it a new injury?

17:15.170 --> 17:16.080
Yes!

17:16.100 --> 17:17.720
It's an injury caused recently.

17:18.820 --> 17:19.990
How about teeth?

17:20.010 --> 17:22.170
Three teeth missing. The position is correct.

17:24.130 --> 17:26.930
So this is Xiao En without a doubt.

17:27.100 --> 17:28.320
Your Excellency,

17:28.410 --> 17:30.720
I think it's a bit strange

17:30.740 --> 17:32.600
that Xiao En just died like that.

17:32.860 --> 17:34.320
It's sort of...

17:36.460 --> 17:39.010
I think he is Xiao En.

17:39.410 --> 17:41.440
Yeah, he surely is!

17:47.530 --> 17:50.080
I'm just curious about

17:50.380 --> 17:52.320
where Fan Xian is right now.

18:24.770 --> 18:26.370
There it comes!

18:29.050 --> 18:30.580
The last load?

18:30.580 --> 18:32.010
Yeah, the last load.

18:39.460 --> 18:41.530
31, 32,

18:41.530 --> 18:43.890
33,

18:43.890 --> 18:45.110
34,

18:45.130 --> 18:46.680
35,

18:46.700 --> 18:47.990
36,

18:48.010 --> 18:50.220
36, 37,

18:50.220 --> 18:51.890
38,

18:52.340 --> 18:54.030
39.

18:54.050 --> 18:56.930
Eh...

18:57.890 --> 19:00.530
How come there is an extra one?

19:53.820 --> 19:55.410
They are warriors.

19:55.700 --> 19:56.870
Bury them together.

19:56.890 --> 19:58.080
Sure!

19:59.130 --> 20:02.440
Let's get back to town and visit the Grand General.

20:39.170 --> 20:41.720
It's all blocked in the direction to town

20:42.380 --> 20:45.800
especially in the direction to the Grand General's residence.

21:17.820 --> 21:19.480
Commander-in-Chief of Embroidered Uniform Guard

21:19.500 --> 21:20.700
Shen Zhong pays respects

21:20.700 --> 21:22.440
to the Grand General!

21:40.930 --> 21:42.930
Greetings to you, Grand General!

21:47.290 --> 21:48.870
I have something to report

21:48.890 --> 21:50.800
and have to bother you with it.

21:51.620 --> 21:53.680
Today, we got some rebels that tried to break in the prison

21:53.770 --> 21:55.410
and take Xiao En away.

21:55.530 --> 21:56.990
Fortunately, they didn't run away.

21:57.010 --> 21:58.440
We caught them.

21:58.460 --> 22:00.080
What are these people like?

22:00.100 --> 22:01.320
We don't know!

22:01.860 --> 22:04.720
Those rebels burnt themselves.

22:05.170 --> 22:07.080
It's hard to tell their identity.

22:08.410 --> 22:10.250
Why do you

22:10.860 --> 22:12.890
report something like this to me?

22:13.740 --> 22:15.170
Because Xiao En

22:15.380 --> 22:18.480
was also burnt to death.

22:18.860 --> 22:21.170
He is, after all, your adoptive father.

22:21.340 --> 22:23.930
It's necessary to report it to you.

22:26.410 --> 22:27.930
Alright!

22:35.340 --> 22:37.100
These rebels from today charged

22:37.100 --> 22:39.560
with spears like this as well.

22:39.740 --> 22:41.250
What do they look like?

22:42.170 --> 22:44.130
We can't tell as they have their face masked.

22:47.410 --> 22:48.930
Do you know anyone else

22:49.340 --> 22:51.680
who uses this type of spear, Grand General?

22:56.050 --> 22:57.890
I don't know.

23:00.650 --> 23:02.100
Grand General,

23:02.100 --> 23:04.200
you spear seems to have the smell of blood.

23:06.410 --> 23:08.480
So what?

23:09.530 --> 23:11.320
It's just off the top of my head.

23:17.170 --> 23:18.650
Good spear!

23:19.740 --> 23:20.930
By the way,

23:22.220 --> 23:23.960
I've got one more thing to report.

23:23.980 --> 23:25.130
Empress Dowager

23:25.130 --> 23:26.100
has been hesitant about

23:26.100 --> 23:27.910
whether to use Xiao En or not

23:27.930 --> 23:30.200
in future.

23:31.620 --> 23:33.290
You know it very well that

23:34.130 --> 23:36.290
I've been cruel to Xiao En.

23:36.500 --> 23:39.370
If he is really used,

23:39.500 --> 23:41.930
what shall I do in future?

23:41.930 --> 23:43.200
What do you think?

23:43.740 --> 23:45.680
You do feel afraid?

23:46.530 --> 23:48.290
I'm timid as always

23:48.620 --> 23:50.290
and naturally feel afraid.

23:55.130 --> 23:57.250
I've considered killing Xiao En,

23:58.050 --> 23:58.930
but if I kill him,

23:58.930 --> 24:01.130
the Empress Dowager won't spare me.

24:02.130 --> 24:03.770
Those rebels tried to break into the prison

24:03.770 --> 24:05.680
only to have him killed,

24:05.740 --> 24:08.720
which helps me eliminate the hidden danger.

24:10.290 --> 24:12.320
I should congratulate you on this then,

24:12.340 --> 24:13.890
Your Excellency!

24:16.290 --> 24:18.320
Grand General, do you know

24:18.500 --> 24:20.340
I invited Langtao and He Daoren

24:20.340 --> 24:21.990
to watch in private?

24:22.010 --> 24:24.200
If there is really someone

24:24.220 --> 24:25.720
planning for secret rescue,

24:25.740 --> 24:27.680
the intervention of two martial arts masters of Ninth Dan

24:27.700 --> 24:30.530
can truly eliminate the hidden danger.

24:33.340 --> 24:35.460
If someone escapes in the chaos,

24:35.460 --> 24:36.700
is it possible that

24:36.700 --> 24:38.910
he runs to your residence?

24:38.930 --> 24:41.250
If no one comes till now,

24:41.410 --> 24:42.410
I think he should probably

24:42.410 --> 24:44.650
be dead already.

24:46.530 --> 24:48.650
This is really a good spear.

24:55.460 --> 24:57.170
If nobody saves him,

24:58.100 --> 25:00.410
there is really no reason for me to kill him.

25:01.130 --> 25:02.910
Grand General,

25:02.930 --> 25:04.770
who do you think

25:04.890 --> 25:07.130
victimized Xiao En?

25:19.530 --> 25:21.290
I probably should leave for now.

25:21.340 --> 25:23.010
Excuse me!

25:48.500 --> 25:50.340
Shangshan Hu is invincible.

25:50.340 --> 25:52.230
His prestige in the army is increasing each day.

25:52.250 --> 25:53.510
If we leave him like that,

25:53.530 --> 25:55.480
he will become a great threat to Beiqi.

25:55.500 --> 25:57.390
If he attempted to kill me today,

25:57.410 --> 25:59.290
we can surely convict him with it.

26:01.250 --> 26:02.930
What a pity!

26:03.100 --> 26:05.080
If he really attempted to, Your Excellency...

26:05.250 --> 26:06.250
As Embroidered Uniform Guards,

26:06.250 --> 26:07.870
we take charge of the prison and punishment.

26:07.890 --> 26:09.960
We usually arrest thieves, bandits and malefactors secretly

26:09.980 --> 26:11.910
and often interrogate them

26:11.930 --> 26:13.100
in the most merciless and ruthless way.

26:13.100 --> 26:15.130
All that is to ensure safety of Beiqi.

26:15.290 --> 26:16.380
If my death today

26:16.380 --> 26:18.270
can be traded for the imprisonment of this rebel,

26:18.290 --> 26:20.650
it's nothing to be afraid of.

26:27.010 --> 26:28.370
What a pity!

26:29.740 --> 26:31.200
What a pity!

27:12.580 --> 27:14.600
He Daoren.

27:21.100 --> 27:23.370
Shen Zhong is adept in scheming.

27:27.620 --> 27:29.010
What are you waiting for?

28:49.650 --> 28:51.170
He is old anyway.

28:56.860 --> 28:59.960
Time kills most, doesn't it?

29:04.820 --> 29:06.320
Shen Zhong sent you here?

29:06.340 --> 29:07.600
Yes!

29:07.980 --> 29:08.860
Tell Shen Zhong you lost him

29:08.860 --> 29:10.170
and give him to me.

29:10.620 --> 29:11.840
No!

29:12.410 --> 29:13.250
Or tell Shen Zhong

29:13.250 --> 29:14.910
he slipped off the precipice.

29:14.930 --> 29:15.720
Don't worry!

29:15.740 --> 29:17.560
I won't allow him to show up again.

29:18.250 --> 29:20.530
I'm not the only one who come to kill him.

29:22.100 --> 29:24.050
Langtao is there!

30:06.250 --> 30:08.770
Shen Zhong really thinks too much of me.

30:09.250 --> 30:12.410
How about Ku He? Why hasn't he come?

30:12.640 --> 30:14.560
=Langtao, first apprentice of Great Master Ku He=

30:14.580 --> 30:16.530
My master enjoined me

30:17.130 --> 30:19.600
not to let you live.

30:19.650 --> 30:21.480
I can't disobey it.

30:21.500 --> 30:23.130
Please excuse me for that.

30:25.740 --> 30:27.220
As Ku He's apprentice,

30:27.220 --> 30:28.270
you're just like him.

30:28.290 --> 30:29.750
Seemingly righteous and merciful,

30:29.770 --> 30:31.100
but actually crafty and wicked

30:31.100 --> 30:33.390
in private.

30:33.410 --> 30:34.990
Kill me as you wish!

30:35.010 --> 30:37.440
Don't make it seem so aggrieved.

31:14.100 --> 31:15.440
I must save him.

31:15.580 --> 31:16.530
I can't help you.

31:16.530 --> 31:18.200
Shen Zhong has started to doubt me.

31:18.220 --> 31:19.130
You don't need to do it publicly.

31:19.130 --> 31:20.770
Just stop him with a few moves in the dark.

31:20.820 --> 31:21.700
It's an abyss over there.

31:21.700 --> 31:23.290
You can't escape.

31:23.700 --> 31:25.530
That's not your business.

31:36.770 --> 31:38.130
Watch out!

32:25.620 --> 32:26.840
Your Majesty!

32:27.340 --> 32:28.480
Your Majesty!

32:29.220 --> 32:30.410
Your Majesty!

32:33.740 --> 32:35.410
I'm fine! I'm OK!

32:35.650 --> 32:38.440
I just had a bad dream.

32:39.170 --> 32:42.510
I was worried and rushed in abruptly.

32:42.530 --> 32:44.130
I'm willing to take penalty.

32:46.740 --> 32:49.390
Any news from our mission to Beiqi?

32:49.410 --> 32:50.600
Your Majesty,

32:50.860 --> 32:51.860
the Beiqi capital city

32:51.860 --> 32:53.720
is too far away from here.

32:53.740 --> 32:54.750
It takes a long time

32:54.770 --> 32:56.150
to deliver messages.

32:56.170 --> 32:59.080
We haven't got any till now.

33:00.410 --> 33:01.680
Your Majesty,

33:02.250 --> 33:03.360
you've been away from the palace

33:03.380 --> 33:04.650
for a few days.

33:04.650 --> 33:06.980
Empress Dowager is a bit worried.

33:06.980 --> 33:07.380
OK!

33:07.380 --> 33:09.080
Leave me! Leave me!

33:09.460 --> 33:10.800
Yes!

33:36.820 --> 33:39.840
There is no trace. I'm afraid they are dead.

33:40.580 --> 33:42.290
Who is the guy bumping in?

33:43.170 --> 33:44.800
I don't know.

33:49.380 --> 33:50.960
We must find their corpses if dead.

33:51.220 --> 33:52.720
Search down there!

34:34.940 --> 34:36.840
We just sorted out the battlefield report

34:36.860 --> 34:38.240
for Fan Xian's battle at the border.

34:38.290 --> 34:39.210
The news has been intermittent

34:39.210 --> 34:40.670
ever since they reached Beiqi

34:40.690 --> 34:41.920
and stopped altogether

34:41.940 --> 34:43.730
after they reached Shangjing.

34:45.490 --> 34:47.520
Yan Bingyun was captured.

34:47.860 --> 34:50.490
The agent network lurks in Shangjing.

34:51.580 --> 34:53.840
That's something beyond our control.

34:54.140 --> 34:56.230
Fei Jie is investigating Fan Xian's affair.

34:56.250 --> 34:58.010
Don't let him see this report.

34:58.010 --> 35:00.130
Don't worry. This is the only copy.

35:00.770 --> 35:02.760
Fan Xian's whereabouts is unknown at the moment.

35:03.340 --> 35:04.670
Don't you have any other agent

35:04.690 --> 35:06.450
in Shangjing?

35:09.210 --> 35:10.930
If I had,

35:11.140 --> 35:13.800
Yan Bingyun wouldn't have been captured.

35:19.900 --> 35:21.080
Go there and check it out.

35:21.100 --> 35:22.410
Yes!

35:33.140 --> 35:34.180
You guys go to the woods.

35:34.180 --> 35:35.320
Yes! Yes!

35:42.180 --> 35:44.170
Report, no one on this side.

35:47.050 --> 35:49.170
How is Xiao En's injury?

35:49.380 --> 35:51.800
The cut on his chest leaves him no chance of surviving.

35:51.820 --> 35:53.520
He can't be saved.

35:58.450 --> 36:00.230
Whoever wants to save him,

36:00.250 --> 36:02.040
it will end up in vain.

36:05.730 --> 36:07.210
Wait for a few more minutes!

36:07.690 --> 36:09.600
If we can find the corpse,

36:09.620 --> 36:10.860
it will be an explanation

36:10.860 --> 36:12.410
to Commander Shen.

36:16.690 --> 36:18.600
Report, no findings.

36:19.860 --> 36:20.820
Search harder!

36:20.820 --> 36:22.240
Yes!

36:23.620 --> 36:26.270
Any news from Fan Xian?

36:26.290 --> 36:28.490
Nothing abnormal after they reached Shangjing.

36:28.620 --> 36:29.670
Is there any battlefield report?

36:29.690 --> 36:30.490
No!

36:30.490 --> 36:31.800
Shadow!

36:35.970 --> 36:37.490
Why?

36:39.580 --> 36:40.100
Because you've been holding

36:40.100 --> 36:42.240
something back from me.

36:51.580 --> 36:53.030
Nobody ever sees

36:53.050 --> 36:54.340
what Shadow looks like

36:54.340 --> 36:56.840
over the years.

37:03.420 --> 37:04.840
It is you!

37:40.180 --> 37:41.210
What's wrong with Shadow?

37:41.210 --> 37:42.650
He fell asleep.

37:42.860 --> 37:44.690
Did you see his face?

37:45.420 --> 37:46.930
I did.

37:47.940 --> 37:50.240
Don't disclose his identity!

37:50.380 --> 37:52.240
Fan Xian encountered

37:52.580 --> 37:54.710
Haitang Duoduo,

37:54.730 --> 37:57.130
Yan Xiaoyi and Shangshan Hu in the battle at the border.

37:58.010 --> 38:00.650
His life is in grave danger.

38:01.820 --> 38:03.360
Where are you black knights?

38:03.380 --> 38:05.210
I withdrew the black knights from the mission.

38:05.210 --> 38:06.210
You know well that

38:06.210 --> 38:08.490
the journey is full of danger.

38:10.180 --> 38:11.140
You're killing him.

38:11.140 --> 38:12.650
He is still alive.

38:13.530 --> 38:14.890
Chen Pingping!

38:15.860 --> 38:17.250
I won't allow you

38:17.250 --> 38:19.690
to let Fan Xian be your puppet.

38:20.290 --> 38:21.420
He is the only and last apprentice

38:21.420 --> 38:22.880
I have.

38:22.900 --> 38:24.800
I'll ensure his safety

38:25.250 --> 38:26.800
even if it means to work against you.

38:26.820 --> 38:28.160
I've hidden the report

38:28.180 --> 38:30.040
about Fan Xian very well.

38:30.140 --> 38:32.270
Your technique of applying poison is indeed unparallel,

38:32.290 --> 38:35.230
but perceiving chances

38:35.250 --> 38:36.600
is not something you're good at.

38:36.620 --> 38:38.410
There must be someone helping you.

38:39.140 --> 38:41.520
He is right here, isn't he?

38:44.450 --> 38:46.370
He's got it right.

38:46.420 --> 38:48.000
Come out for a meeting then!

38:54.770 --> 38:56.800
I knew it is you!

38:56.820 --> 38:58.130
It's not detected

38:58.290 --> 39:00.600
in the yard till now.

39:00.620 --> 39:02.640
Only you are able to do so.

39:02.660 --> 39:04.240
You said

39:04.580 --> 39:05.940
it was meant to help Fan Xian

39:05.940 --> 39:07.430
to gain success and fame for him to go to Beiqi.

39:07.450 --> 39:08.710
I did say that.

39:08.730 --> 39:09.800
You also promised

39:09.820 --> 39:11.190
to ensure his safety.

39:11.210 --> 39:12.180
I did!

39:12.180 --> 39:13.180
But you withdrew the black knights

39:13.180 --> 39:14.660
protecting the mission anyhow

39:14.660 --> 39:16.490
and allowed him to take the risk alone.

39:17.290 --> 39:18.380
You want to victimize him.

39:18.380 --> 39:19.470
He is alive!

39:19.490 --> 39:20.530
You leave him

39:20.530 --> 39:22.840
facing several Ninth Dan martial arts masters alone.

39:23.290 --> 39:24.470
Allow him to continue!

39:24.490 --> 39:25.800
What I did

39:25.860 --> 39:27.380
is meant to figure out

39:27.380 --> 39:29.080
the secret of Xiao En.

39:29.420 --> 39:31.430
What does it have to do with Fan Xian?

39:31.450 --> 39:32.800
He didn't disclose it in all those years,

39:32.820 --> 39:34.530
surely not to Fan Xian either.

39:34.530 --> 39:35.970
I think he will.

39:36.100 --> 39:37.370
Why?

39:41.180 --> 39:43.410
I can tell you the reason behind,

39:45.210 --> 39:47.210
but he can't listen to it.

39:48.380 --> 39:49.620
Do you think

39:49.620 --> 39:51.240
I dare not take action against you?

39:52.250 --> 39:53.670
We're going to meet him.

39:53.690 --> 39:54.970
Whom?

39:55.210 --> 39:55.900
Whose arrangement was it

39:55.900 --> 39:57.320
to withdraw the black knights?

39:58.580 --> 40:00.130
Trust me!

40:01.010 --> 40:02.410
I'll go with him

40:03.180 --> 40:04.760
for this matter.

40:05.250 --> 40:06.930
You can't go!

40:08.660 --> 40:09.660
Wait! What if

40:09.660 --> 40:11.450
I do?

40:13.730 --> 40:15.970
I know you don't fear death,

40:16.140 --> 40:17.360
but you can help Fan Xian

40:17.380 --> 40:19.170
as long as you stay alive.

40:19.290 --> 40:20.730
I promise you

40:21.100 --> 40:23.030
if Fan Xian really dies,

40:23.050 --> 40:25.410
I'll avenge him with you in the capital city.

40:33.490 --> 40:35.880
Whoever wants to kill Fan Xian,

40:35.900 --> 40:37.400
I'll bury the whole world with him

40:37.420 --> 40:39.410
if he dies.

41:02.420 --> 41:04.000
If it were only He Daoren

41:04.970 --> 41:06.800
and Langtao

41:06.970 --> 41:08.950
in those years,

41:08.970 --> 41:11.560
there is no chance for me to lose.

41:11.580 --> 41:13.600
If an old man keeps talking about his past years,

41:13.860 --> 41:16.040
he is dying soon.

41:16.420 --> 41:18.800
I am dying already.

41:35.250 --> 41:38.080
The antidote is a waste on me.

41:44.100 --> 41:45.920
Let me stop the bleeding first.

41:45.940 --> 41:48.800
It's useless. I know.

41:48.940 --> 41:51.690
Langtao's cut has broken my heart vessel.

42:02.450 --> 42:03.930
What are you laughing at?

42:04.420 --> 42:06.240
I'm laughing at you, Fan Xian.

42:06.940 --> 42:08.470
What is there to laugh about me?

42:08.490 --> 42:10.130
Nothing,

42:10.290 --> 42:12.000
but you saved me.

42:12.580 --> 42:14.450
I'm happy.

42:15.010 --> 42:17.080
You start to talk nonsense.

42:22.010 --> 42:23.840
So withdrawing black knights

42:23.970 --> 42:25.640
and putting Fan Xian in danger

42:25.660 --> 42:28.130
are the ideas from Your Majesty?

42:28.450 --> 42:30.010
If Your Majesty wants to kill Fan Xian,

42:30.010 --> 42:31.430
just issue an edict.

42:31.450 --> 42:33.050
What's the need to take such big movements

42:33.050 --> 42:35.040
and send him to Beiqi?!

42:35.900 --> 42:37.240
After all,

42:37.380 --> 42:39.270
he is nothing but an official

42:39.290 --> 42:41.840
whose life and death are in the hands of Your Majesty.

43:08.040 --> 43:11.620
In the river of history,

43:11.640 --> 43:15.110
time goes round and round.

43:17.920 --> 43:21.260
Memories about the former and present lives

43:21.280 --> 43:25.350
join each other in an endless way.

43:27.240 --> 43:29.860
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:29.880 --> 43:32.120
one season follows another in a flash,

43:32.120 --> 43:34.620
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:34.640 --> 43:36.240
I just can't give up

43:36.240 --> 43:39.580
to be with you for my whole life.

43:39.600 --> 43:45.070
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:46.320 --> 43:48.870
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:49.160 --> 43:51.200
Year after year in the wandering,

43:51.200 --> 43:53.860
I count the remaining years.

43:53.880 --> 43:56.060
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:56.080 --> 43:58.070
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:58.360 --> 44:00.750
I never feel regretful.

44:00.800 --> 44:02.160
In such a chaotic world,

44:02.160 --> 44:05.140
I still miss you as ever.

44:05.160 --> 44:08.110
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:08.400 --> 44:10.460
With a gentle heart,

44:10.480 --> 44:13.140
I cherish our remaining years.

44:13.160 --> 44:14.680
Even though we have to go through

44:14.680 --> 44:17.190
all the hardships along the journey,

44:17.320 --> 44:24.510
you always stay by my side,

44:24.600 --> 44:27.270
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:27.560 --> 44:29.640
Year after year in the wandering,

44:29.640 --> 44:32.300
I count the remaining years.

44:32.320 --> 44:34.460
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:34.480 --> 44:36.710
even though we end up the destiny,

44:36.920 --> 44:39.100
I never feel regretful.

44:39.120 --> 44:40.520
In such a chaotic world,

44:40.520 --> 44:43.580
I still miss you as ever.

44:43.600 --> 44:46.710
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:46.800 --> 44:48.940
With a gentle heart,

44:48.960 --> 44:51.660
I cherish our remaining years.

44:51.680 --> 44:53.120
Even though we have to go through

44:53.120 --> 44:55.780
all the hardships along the journey,

44:55.800 --> 45:04.560
you always stay by my side...
